From 6b3edad64c0a2c26b2c582078a549a63b2c233cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:54:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] r4-prep D: journey lake reads the board's water source
 (shared lakesideWaterMaterial / applyLakesideWaterMode)

The board's lakeside-water.mtl setup is now two shared helpers written only from LAKESIDE_DIR_LIGHT_PARAMS and
lakesideModeLighting(mode); the journey's lake takes its own copy through the same helpers (and follows the
day/night toggle), so Voice Bot's values show on both sides of the swap. No values changed. The water shader is
then also compiled during the journey, not in the board's first frame. Sky: the journey end sky is the shared
clear colour once the island props fade (C). Test: tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_shared_water.cjs.
